        "level": null,
        "description": "You have a prominent scar, deformity, or other physical mark that causes negative reactions from others. This can make social interactions difficult and you may be shunned or targeted by prejudiced individuals.",
        "baselinePoints": 0,
        "category": "Physical",
        "cost": -10
      },
      {
        "name": "Loner",
        "points": -5,
        "level": null,
        "description": "You prefer solitude and find it difficult to work in groups or rely on others. This can leave you isolated and vulnerable when teamwork is crucial, making you an easier target.",
        "baselinePoints": 0,
        "category": "Mental",
        "cost": -5
      },
      {
        "name": "Post-Combat Shakes",
        "points": -5,
        "level": null,
        "description": "After intense combat, you experience physical tremors or emotional distress. This can leave you vulnerable in prolonged engagements or successive encounters. Range: -5 to -10 points.",
        "baselinePoints": 0,
        "category": "Mental",
        "cost": -5
      },
      {
        "name": "Flashbacks",
        "points": -5,
        "level": null,
        "description": "You experience vivid, disturbing memories of past traumatic events, often triggered by stress. These episodes can render you temporarily helpless and vulnerable in critical moments. Range: -5 to -15 points.",
        "baselinePoints": 0,
        "category": "Mental",
        "cost": -5
      },
      {
        "name": "Stubbornness",
        "points": -5,
        "level": null,
        "description": "The character is unusually resistant to changing their mind or admitting they are wrong, even in the face of overwhelming evidence. This can lead to missed opportunities or continued pursuit of flawed plans despite clear warning signs.",
